# HOLON_HAND_AUTHORED_SIDECAR), run TWICE by independent measurers: 0/9 vs 2/9, then 1/9 vs 1/9
# (unpinned full_headless vs initial_state pinned to storage={Turso} sync={} actors={}). NO wiring
# effect is demonstrated at that sample size (one-sided Fisher exact p = 0.235 for the more
# favourable pair). Both arms reproduce the same signature (watch_view_… matview 13 / recompute 12,
# `bulk-3-5 @ parent bulk-3-0` retained), so the red is the timing race, not the draw.
# The pin is left OFF because it is not shown to help — NOT because it keeps the gate green: this
