#
# --- dotted page titles collide onto ONE file (BugFunnel 2026-08-02) --------------
# `VaultPath::page_file_from_name_chain` derived the page file with
# `Path::with_extension("org")`, which REPLACES the segment after the last dot instead of
# appending. Two sibling pages titled `citrix-STX` and `citrix-STX.BROWSER_AGENT` (the real
# live-vault shape) therefore both derived `…/citrix-STX.org`: whichever page materialized
# second found the path occupied, took the do-not-clobber early return, and stayed FILELESS.
# The generator cannot reach this — every page title the keystone draws (`TITLE_POOL`,
# `BlockToPage` contents) is dotless, so an append and a replace are indistinguishable.
# RED (pre-fix) on `inv-every-page-has-its-own-file`: "page `…` owns NO file".
{"name": "page-renamed-to-a-dotted-title-rehomes", "description": "A page RENAMED to a dotted title must re-home onto the file that title names. This is the rename half of the truncation: the write-back moves the page from `pagea.org` to `<new-title>.org` and removes the old file, so a truncating derivation both mis-files the page and mis-computes which old file to delete. Same opening as `page-id-rename-collision` (the minted id is H(\"structural-page/pagea\")), only the new title carries dots.", "transitions": [{"CreateBlockUnderFocus": {"content": "pagea", "id": "block:pgorigin"}}, {"CreateBlockUnderFocus": {"content": "child", "id": "block:pgchild"}}, {"Indent": {"block_id": "block:pgchild"}}, {"BlockToPage": {"origin_id": "block:pgorigin"}}, {"RenamePage": {"page_id": "block:a6bbdb1d-4e3d-e3d3-2c8d-c38a0efb5458", "new_title": "citrix-STX.BROWSER_AGENT"}}]}
{"name": "dotted-page-title-owns-its-own-file", "description": "Two sibling pages whose titles differ only after a dot must own two DIFFERENT files. `with_extension(\"org\")` truncated the dotted title onto the dotless one's path, leaving one page fileless (and, in a real vault, silently overwritten). Derivation must APPEND `.org` to the title, never replace at its last dot.", "transitions": [{"CreateBlockUnderFocus": {"content": "citrix-STX", "id": "block:dotless-page"}}, {"CreateBlockUnderFocus": {"content": "citrix-STX.BROWSER_AGENT", "id": "block:dotted-page"}}, {"BlockToPage": {"origin_id": "block:dotless-page"}}, {"BlockToPage": {"origin_id": "block:dotted-page"}}]}

# --- F2 org-blocks-ref-diverge: oracle undo over-reverts file-ingested CONTENT blocks ---
